# FocusORM Environment Configuration
#
# Preferred: Use the dashboard → Settings → AI Provider to configure your Groq key.
#   The key will be stored securely in ~/.FocusORM/credentials.json on your local machine.
#   It is never committed to Git and never exposed to the frontend.
#
# Legacy fallback: you can still set GROQ_API_KEY here if you prefer .env-based setup.
#   Get a free key at https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
